{"id":"706ec43817cfe97e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_ArUC.md","title":"ArUC","display":"ArUC","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"ArUC","parameters":["a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"ArUC"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论公理代码。有序参数：<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ ArUC a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F (exists R (exists f (exists r (and (@ ArSig E F R f r) (@ FClosure E F R f r a b)))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35d6d56fbb2c8833\" href=\"?note=35d6d56fbb2c8833\" title=\"ZFC_ArSig\">ArSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8b1332dd97b2603\" href=\"?note=a8b1332dd97b2603\" title=\"ZFC_FClosure\">FClosure</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ ArUC a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开